0022:     - Gray is reserved for the alternating marker pixels.
0023: 
0024:     Rule:
0025:     - Draw vertical bars upward from the seed row every two columns to the right.
0026:     - Place gray pixels in the intervening columns.
0027:     - Alternate the gray marker row between the top and bottom edge.
0028: 
0029:     Key insight:
0030:     - The seed pixel determines the color and phase of a periodic pattern across the remaining columns.
0031:     """
